{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 1362070,
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "44246160",
      "title": "Combining Server and Client Components",
      "sourceHash": "bc575b2cd0de67e2d4ecb3279ef3364629461f97c14173a929db3b5eb8496aa7",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.13,
          "end": 4.8,
          "en": "Now when it comes to working",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.8,
          "end": 7.2,
          "en": "with React server components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.2,
          "end": 8.7,
          "en": "and client components,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.7,
          "end": 12.3,
          "en": "there are certain rules you should be aware of",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.3,
          "end": 17.1,
          "en": "when it comes to combining these two types of components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 17.1,
          "end": 19.5,
          "en": "Because it's important to understand",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 19.5,
          "end": 21,
          "en": "and keep in mind",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 21,
          "end": 25.26,
          "en": "that React server components can directly include",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 25.26,
          "end": 28.95,
          "en": "client components in their JSX code,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 28.95,
          "end": 31.683,
          "en": "but the other way around, it won't work.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 32.7,
          "end": 36.3,
          "en": "So client components can't directly include",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 36.3,
          "end": 39,
          "en": "server components in their JSX code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 39,
          "end": 40.74,
          "en": "With one exception,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 40.74,
          "end": 45.063,
          "en": "they can accept server components as children.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 46.05,
          "end": 49.56,
          "en": "So this here would be allowed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 49.56,
          "end": 52.11,
          "en": "Here I'm rendering a server component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 52.11,
          "end": 55.203,
          "en": "which then uses a client component inside of it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 56.19,
          "end": 57.45,
          "en": "This, on the other hand,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 57.45,
          "end": 60.6,
          "en": "would not be allowed, rendering a client component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 60.6,
          "end": 63.33,
          "en": "which tries to render a server component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 63.33,
          "end": 68.33,
          "en": "That won't work unless it's done with help of children.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 68.34,
          "end": 70.83,
          "en": "So if the client component tags",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 70.83,
          "end": 74.03999999999999,
          "en": "are wrapped around the server component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 74.03999999999999,
          "end": 76.68,
          "en": "this will work again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 76.68,
          "end": 79.38,
          "en": "Now translated to our project here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 79.38,
          "end": 83.37,
          "en": "this means that in the React server component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 83.37,
          "end": 86.94,
          "en": "we can use this client demo component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 86.94,
          "end": 88.95,
          "en": "We can import this here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 88.95,
          "end": 92.91,
          "en": "and output this component as part of the JSX code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 92.91,
          "end": 94.713,
          "en": "of this server component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 95.67,
          "end": 99,
          "en": "If you do that, you see that the client component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 99,
          "end": 101.64,
          "en": "is rendered inside of the server component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 101.64,
          "end": 103.743,
          "en": "This works without any issues.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 105.24000000000001,
          "end": 109.44,
          "en": "Now let me comment this out and also comment out this import",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 109.44,
          "end": 112.08,
          "en": "and let's try something else.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 112.08,
          "end": 115.32,
          "en": "Let's try including the server component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 115.32,
          "end": 117.81,
          "en": "instead of this children placeholder here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 117.81,
          "end": 119.85,
          "en": "in the client component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 119.85,
          "end": 123.93,
          "en": "So now I'm importing my React server component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 123.93,
          "end": 127.44,
          "en": "and I'm trying to output it as part of the JSX code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 127.44,
          "end": 128.823,
          "en": "of this client component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 129.99,
          "end": 133.35,
          "en": "If you do that, you might expect an error,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 133.35,
          "end": 136.5,
          "en": "but actually this also works",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 136.5,
          "end": 140.52,
          "en": "as you see the server component is included here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 140.52,
          "end": 141.933,
          "en": "in the client component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 143.22,
          "end": 145.56,
          "en": "So why is this working",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 145.56,
          "end": 148.8,
          "en": "if I just told you that this does not work?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 148.8,
          "end": 151.32,
          "en": "Well, because by default,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 151.32,
          "end": 155.7,
          "en": "next JS or this project setup here, which supports",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 155.7,
          "end": 159.51,
          "en": "server components simply converts a component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 159.51,
          "end": 162.31,
          "en": "that's used inside of a client component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 163.23,
          "end": 165.3,
          "en": "to a client component as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 165.3,
          "end": 169.23,
          "en": "So this RSC demo component is converted",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 169.23,
          "end": 171.27,
          "en": "to a client component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 171.27,
          "end": 173.28,
          "en": "because it's being used in a component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 173.28,
          "end": 175.503,
          "en": "that's marked as a client component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 176.67000000000002,
          "end": 177.87,
          "en": "That's why it works.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 177.87,
          "end": 181.8,
          "en": "But now this isn't a server component anymore.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 181.8,
          "end": 183.96,
          "en": "Instead, now with that, you will see",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 183.96,
          "end": 186.78,
          "en": "that if you open your log on the client side,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 186.78,
          "end": 189.813,
          "en": "RSC demo is also rendered here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 191.46,
          "end": 195.57,
          "en": "Now, we could force this RSC demo component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 195.57,
          "end": 197.7,
          "en": "to be a server component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 197.7,
          "end": 199.59,
          "en": "by adding the async keyword",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 199.59,
          "end": 201.363,
          "en": "in front of the function keyword.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 202.44,
          "end": 206.57999999999998,
          "en": "Because server components can be async functions,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 206.57999999999998,
          "end": 209.34,
          "en": "something which normally isn't allowed in React,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 209.34,
          "end": 213.42000000000002,
          "en": "but it is allowed for React server components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 213.42000000000002,
          "end": 216.75,
          "en": "But since this is not allowed for client components,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 216.75,
          "end": 220.503,
          "en": "now if you save this, if you reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 221.46,
          "end": 226.46,
          "en": "you will get an error here in your client side browser log.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 226.5,
          "end": 228.32999999999998,
          "en": "You'll get a warning that async await",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 228.32999999999998,
          "end": 230.67000000000002,
          "en": "is not yet supported in client components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 230.67000000000002,
          "end": 232.773,
          "en": "Only for server components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 233.76,
          "end": 236.31,
          "en": "Now of course here at the moment, we have no reason",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 236.31,
          "end": 238.47,
          "en": "to mark this as a async function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 238.47,
          "end": 241.86,
          "en": "but that will change once we add data fetching,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 241.86,
          "end": 243.81,
          "en": "which we'll do soon.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 243.81,
          "end": 246.3,
          "en": "But it is a way of forcing a component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 246.3,
          "end": 248.34,
          "en": "to be a server component in the end.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 248.34,
          "end": 252.78,
          "en": "And it proves that this here, using a server component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 252.78,
          "end": 256.02,
          "en": "in a client component does not work",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 256.02,
          "end": 259.65,
          "en": "unless that server component is also converted",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 259.65,
          "end": 260.97,
          "en": "to a client component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 260.97,
          "end": 264.75,
          "en": "which it is automatically if it's possible.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 264.75,
          "end": 266.94,
          "en": "But if it's not possible, like here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 266.94,
          "end": 269.61,
          "en": "where I have async in front of the component function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 269.61,
          "end": 271.89,
          "en": "which is not allowed in client components,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 271.89,
          "end": 274.533,
          "en": "if that's the case, we're getting an error.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 275.58,
          "end": 277.47,
          "en": "Now, what would be possible",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 277.47,
          "end": 282.12,
          "en": "however, is to not use the server component in the JSX code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 282.12,
          "end": 283.53,
          "en": "of the client component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 283.53,
          "end": 287.07,
          "en": "but to instead use the special children prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 287.07,
          "end": 291.15,
          "en": "and remove this RSC demo import here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 291.15,
          "end": 294.6,
          "en": "and pass the server component to the client component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 294.6,
          "end": 298.89,
          "en": "kind of by moving it between the tags",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 298.89,
          "end": 301.17,
          "en": "of this client component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 301.17,
          "end": 305.31,
          "en": "Because by doing this, this server component here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 305.31,
          "end": 308.34,
          "en": "is technically rendered in this home component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 308.34,
          "end": 310.89,
          "en": "which is a server component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 310.89,
          "end": 314.13,
          "en": "and it's then just the rendered code that's sent",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 314.13,
          "end": 315.57,
          "en": "to the client component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 315.57,
          "end": 317.76,
          "en": "That's why this works.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 317.76,
          "end": 322.44,
          "en": "So with this setup, if I reload, the error message is gone,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 322.44,
          "end": 325.92,
          "en": "but we don't see the RSC demo rendered output",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 325.92,
          "end": 327.633,
          "en": "here on the client side.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 328.68,
          "end": 331.65,
          "en": "So this proves that it's not being rendered there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 331.65,
          "end": 334.32,
          "en": "that it's not a client component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 334.32,
          "end": 336.15,
          "en": "but we see it on the screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 336.15,
          "end": 338.4,
          "en": "Because again, it was rendered on the server",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 338.4,
          "end": 342.51,
          "en": "and then just injected into this client component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 342.51,
          "end": 343.343,
          "en": "you could say.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 344.28,
          "end": 348.15,
          "en": "And that's therefore how you can combine server components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 348.15,
          "end": 350.493,
          "en": "and client components in React.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}